#: main.cpp:42
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Kooka provides access to scanner hardware using the <a href=\"http://www."
"sane-project.org/\">SANE</a> library.\n"
"\n"
"Kooka allows you to scan, save and view in any image format that KDE "
"supports, and can perform Optical Character Recognition using the open "
"source <a href=\"http://jocr.sourceforge.net/\">GOCR</a> or <a href=\"http://"
"www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/ocrad.html\">OCRAD</a> programs, or the "
"commercial <a href=\"http://www.rerecognition.com/\">KADMOS</a> library."
msgstr ""
"Kooka fornece acceso a escáneres mediante a biblioteca <a href=\"http://www."
"sane-project.org/\">SANE</a>.\n"
"\n"
"Kooka permítelle dixitalizar, gardar e ver calquera formato de imaxe "
"compatíbel con software de KDE, e pode realizar un recoñecemento óptico de "
"caracteres (OCR) mediante os programas libres <a href=\"http://jocr."
"sourceforge.net/\">GOCR</a> ou <a href=\"http://www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/"
"ocrad.html\">OCRAD</a> ou a biblioteca privativa <a href=\"http://www."
"rerecognition.com/\">KADMOS</a>."

